[00:00.000] 作词 : Jessica Pratt
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Jessica Pratt
[00:22.755] Some days are long and summer days are hard
[00:30.217] I was dragging my feet across the parking lot
[00:36.024] And I remember sad faces in the mirror behind me
[00:43.619] And I saw those blank laces in the driver's seat
[00:50.753] You know I spent a million tears
[00:54.421] Trying to get myself out all these years
[00:58.373] And I had a hard time to get me down
[01:04.100]
[01:07.398] Call you delaney 'cause the tears you rain down
[01:14.550] You call me lady when the chips are down
[01:20.093]
[01:24.027] And then you tell me
[01:25.191] "Cry no tears," I hear you sayin'
[01:30.196] "Cry no tears" is the refrain
[01:34.808] "Cry no tears" again
[01:39.210]
